eśvara Bhaṭṭa, son of Mādhava Bhaṭṭa is regarded a. his rival.\nSee G. Jha, Pūrvamīmām3sā in its sources App. p. 45; Tattvabindu of [Page051-b] Vācaspati Miśra, Ann. Uni. Skt. Ser. 3. Intro. p.. 60ff.\n--C. Śāstradīpikā on Jaiminīyasūtra (adhikaraṇa-wise).\nPt.. with C. Mayūkhamālikā of Somanātha. N. S. Press, Bombay, 1915.\n--Tantraratna.\nSee NCC. VIII. p. 91b.\nAddl. mss.:\nASB. IV. 414. Sūcīpattra 51. Wai D. II. 6216 (inc.). 6217.\nPartly ed. by G. Jha an. Umesh Misra, Sar. Bha. Skt. Texts, Benares.\n--Tarkapāda (1st pāda of Mīm. sūtra). SB. 363.\n--Nyāyaratnamālā. mīm. a. independent work on certain important topics, establishing Kumārila's views an. refuting Prabhākara.\nSee NCC. X. p. 260a-b.\nAddl. ms.\nRASB. XI. 8113.\nPt.. Chowk. Skt. Ser. 7. 1900.\n--C. Nyāyaratnākara on Ślokavārttika. RASB. XI. 8031. 8032 (inc.).\nPt.. with text. Chowk. Skt. Ser. 3.\nSee G. Jha, Pūrvamīmām3sā in its sources App. p.. 37-43.\n--Mīmām3sāvāda (vādārtha). Oppert I. 4788. II. 7234. 7704.\n--Śabdacintāmaṇi.\nQ. by his son Śrīharṣa in his Amarakhaṇḍana, Adyar D. VI. 797.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "parTasaraTisataka": [{"id": "pArTasAraTiSataka", "headword": "पार्थसारथिशतक", "headword_slp1": "pArTasAraTiSataka", "fold": "parTasaraTisataka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ncc", "senses": [{"gloss": "Pārthasārathiśataka\nby Devaśikhāmaṇi Alasiṅgarācārya.\nPt.. in Telugu script. Ananda Press. Madras, 1925. See IO. Pt.. Bk.. 1938, p. 1900. [Page052-a.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "parTasaraTisupraBata": [{"id": "pArTasAraTisupraBAta", "headword": "पार्थसारथिसुप्रभात", "headword_slp1": "pArTasAraTisupraBAta", "fold": "parTasaraTisupraBata", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ncc", "senses": [{"gloss": "Pārthasārathisuprabhāta\nby Krishnasvami Ayyangar.\nPt.. Modern Printing Works. Madras, 1919. See IO. Pt.. Bk.. 1938, p. 1900.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "parTasaraTi(stava)stotra": [{"id": "pArTasAraTi(stava)stotra", "headword": "पार्थसारथि(स्तव)स्तोत्र", "headword_sl